        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART III, LINE 2</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE FOUNDATION BEGAN SUPPORTING STUDENTS WITH STUDENT ENGAGEMENT (WHICH CONSISTED OF ACTIVITIES SUCH AS WELCOME FEST FOR ALL STUDENTS, REC INNOVATIVE LABS AND NASA PROGRAM)</ExplanationTxt>
