        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION A, LINE 4</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>ARTICLE II BI THE NUMBER OF BOARD MEMBERS CHANGED FROM 11 TO A MINIMUM OF 11. ARTICLE II B3 CHANGED FROM 4 TO 5 THE NUMBER OF COLLEGE DIRECTORS, IIB4 ADDS DEFINES TWO NON-VOTING MEMBERS.</ExplanationTxt>
